{"type":"message","id":"2223dc93","parentId":"dc53d5ce","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:17:51.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hmm. `Unauthorized` with Bearer. Let me check if the API expects something specific. Earlier the X-API-Key worked for GET but not POST. Let me try GET with Bearer to see what happens.\n\nActually, earlier the GET requests returned data with X-API-Key header. The POST returns 1101 with X-API-Key. This is a Cloudflare Workers error 1101 - which means \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\"\n\nThis is a server-side issue with the Worker's POST handler. The GET works fine but POST fails with 1101. This isn't an auth issue - it's a code error in the Cloudflare Worker itself.\n\n\nI'll report this to the user and let them know the GET requests are working fine with the X-API-Key header, but the POST endpoint is throwing a Cloudflare error that needs to be fixed on their end.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET 成功返回数据，但 POST `/send` 持续返回 **Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误**（Worker未处理的异常）。这是**平台服务端问题**，不是认证问题。\n\n**总结：**\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常获取双线程消息（X-API-Key: echo-a…key）\n- ❌ POST /send — Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker内部异常）\n- ℹ️ 双线程最新消息均为自动心跳日志，**无需人工响应**的系统状态报告\n- 📊 系统状态良好：755分钟窗口28.4%，S0稳固，B4-E2连续95节点零误报，战略价值39.17/40\n\n**建议：** 检查 `/send` 端点的 Cloudflare Worker 代码中 POST handler 是否有未捕获的异常（如JSON解析、数据库写入等问题）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":384,"output":356,"cacheRead":19728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20468,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779297463800,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8ad6004e-ef8b-4352-97ce-5041407a3ec1"}}
